{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんばんは~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ブログを開いてくださりありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46 四期生 山田桃実(やまだももみ)です☺︎"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15th Single オンラインミート&グリート"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2回目！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ありがとうございました~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobX8byhc.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobdVnJuv.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobaSphVv.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今年の春に一目惚れして買った服を着ました~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "やっと着れた☺︎とるんるんで着ていったら、\n似たような人がいました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobQT0P0Z.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "この方です･8･"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "その上、この日はFIFAワールドカップ2026の日本戦があり\nたまたまサムライブルーになったってこともありました"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いろいろ偶然が重なって面白かったです~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今回もたくさん笑って、頬がつりそうになったことがしばしば、\nでもそれだけ笑顔になれるって素敵だなーって！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "もっともっとあなたのことも笑顔にします( ¨̮ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今週末もオンラインとリアルで2日間連続会えるのとても楽しみです‎^_^"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "待ってるね~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "📢月刊タウン情報おかやま7月号"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "インタビューを掲載していただきます！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "6月25日(木)発売なのですが、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "なんと明日6月23日(火)に、タウン情報おかやまさんの編集室では先行販売が行われるそうです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "7時\n12時\n17時30分\nからの各1時間となっていますのでご都合の良い方はぜひ~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "岡山の夏、全て載っていると思います🌴\n6th TOURも近県であるので、ツアー帰りなどでぜひ岡山に寄ってみてください~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "大阪で開催される、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "OSAKA GIGANTIC MUSIC FESTIVAL 2026\nに出演いたします！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46は8月1日(土)の出演となります~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "そして、\nROCK IN JAPAN FESTIVAL 2026\nに出演いたします！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "櫻坂46は9月21日(月・祝)の出演となります~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "どちらとも四期生にとっては初めての野外フェスです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏もたのしいイベントが盛りだくさんで、今年の夏もうきうきです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "夏、いっぱいはしゃごうね~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ーーー"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobrpv2CL.png", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "今日はこの子の誕生日です🎂\n何歳なんだろう"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "おかえり園田くんシリーズの柴野くんというキャラクターなのですが、ほんとにかわいいです\nでもわたし、ほんとうは猫派です"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "いつも抱き枕になってくれてるからか、首にかなりのシワが、、"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "これからもよろしくねᵔ. ̫.ᵔ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最後までブログを読んでくださりありがとうございます"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またきてね~"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "山田桃実"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "P.S. 柴野のこと、ばのくんってよんでる"}], "source": "official"}